The check report runs every check in turn and stops at the first failure.
The output of a check ends with a line break; it is removed,
so the line break after each reference separates the checks.
@<Language@/Go@/Module@/check report@=
@<@|Language@/Go@/Module@/Go Command@/build packages@+go module@|Tool@/Text Processing@/remove ending newlines@>
